menu "embpet tgbot"

    config EMBPET_TG_TEST
        bool "Bot API client test commands (never enable in production)"
        default n
        help
            Compiles in test-only console commands (`tg t_*`): store a token,
            call getMe / deleteWebhook / getUpdates / sendMessage from two
            worker tasks that own the poll and send connections, and run a
            polling + sending soak with heap statistics. Used by
            tools/tg_test.py.

endmenu
